{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22387","headline":"对酒 · 白居易","name":"对酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人生一百岁，通计三万日。\n何况百岁人，人间百无一。\n贤愚共零落，贵贱同埋没。\n东岱前後魂，北邙新旧骨。\n复闻药误者，爲爱延年术。\n又有忧死者，爲贪政事笔。\n药误不得老，忧死非因疾。\n谁言人最灵，知得不知失。\n何如会亲友，饮此杯中物。\n能沃烦虑消，能陶真性出。\n所以刘阮辈，终年醉兀兀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22387.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22387","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}